        <h1>2024 Presidential Election Results by Massachusetts Town</h1>

        <p>Kamala Harris won Massachusetts in the 2024 presidential election.</p>

        <p>Harris carried 268 of the state’s 351 cities and towns while Donald Trump won 83. Harris’s support is strongest in Greater Boston, the Berkshires, the Pioneer Valley, and Cape Cod and the islands. Trump’s wins are concentrated in south-central and north-central Massachusetts, along the southeastern coast, and in a few towns near the New Hampshire border.</p>

